# oracle: fix qeq/shielded on a group with fixed non-group charges, pair coul/cut, loose tolerance and maxiter 4 (unconverged iterates), run 0 + 10 nve steps (f_q = iterations)
# measured max error vs native (relative): thermo 1.8e-15, atoms 4.7e-15; f_q equal in every row (maxiter 4: unconverged iterates matched). Main before this port: f_q 4 vs 2, atoms 3.1e-2.
# oracle-inputs: w32qeq_shield.params
# oracle-files: w123q_shield_fixed_q.dump
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10 atomrel=1e-8
units metal
atom_style charge
boundary f f f
region box block 0 30 0 30 0 30
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 single 5 15 15
create_atoms 2 single 8 15 15
create_atoms 1 single 11 15 15
create_atoms 2 single 8 18 15
create_atoms 1 single 8 12 15
create_atoms 2 single 13 19 16
mass 1 1.0
mass 2 1.0
set atom 1 charge 0.0
set atom 2 charge 0.0
set atom 3 charge 0.0
set atom 4 charge 0.3
set atom 5 charge -0.2
set atom 6 charge 0.0
group mob id 1 2 3 5 6
group fixed id 4
pair_style coul/cut 12.0
pair_coeff * *
fix q mob qeq/shielded 1 8 1.0e-3 4 w32qeq_shield.params
fix 1 mob nve
velocity mob create 300.0 4928459
timestep 0.001
thermo_style custom step pe ecoul f_q
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo 5
run 0
run 10
write_dump all custom w123q_shield_fixed_q.dump id q modify format float %.15g sort id
